questions.question_es:
¿Qué imprime al definirse la clase?
```python
class Meta(type):
    def __new__(mcs, name, bases, ns):
        print(f"creating {name}")
        return super().__new__(mcs, name, bases, ns)
class A(metaclass=Meta):
    pass
```

